: 0.49, "bm25": 15.97, "dense_rank": 13, "bm25_rank": 4, "rrf": 0.02932, "selected": false}, {"text": "In 1997, NASA worked with the Goddard Space Flight Center, Ball Aerospace & Technologies, and TRW to conduct technical requirement and cost studies of the three", "source": "wikipedia", "dense": 0.49, "bm25": 13.34, "dense_rank": 12, "bm25_rank": 14, "rrf": 0.0274, "selected": false}, {"text": "15 scientists to support mission operations at the Space Telescope Science Institute (STScI) in Baltimore, USA. In return for the European contributions, ESA ga", "source": "web", "dense": 0.565, "bm25": 11.47, "dense_rank": 4, "bm25_rank": 26, "rrf": 0.02725, "selected": false}], "selected": 3, "echo_filtered": 0, "kept": 3}, "t": 12.625}
